# TEMPLATE — multi-strain consensus mode.
# ONE file per fragment/segment. Each record is the SAME fragment from a
# DIFFERENT strain. flexprobe aligns them, builds a consensus, then designs
# either conserved probes (bind every strain) or strain-unique probes.
# Name the file after the fragment (e.g. OROV_L.fa, OROV_M.fa, OROV_S.fa) and
# give each record a strain id. Keep one fragment per file; for 3 segments of
# 2 strains you make 3 files and drag them in together (bulk mode).
